<h1>About TaskFlow</h1>
<p>TaskFlow is the project we build together in this course.</p>
<p>So far it is an ASP.NET Core MVC application that lists, shows and adds tasks.
   The tasks live in the server's memory, so they disappear when the app stops.</p>
<p>New here? <a asp-controller="Tasks" asp-action="Create">Add your first task</a>.</p>
